{"shortDescription":"Festi hf. has completed the sale of a new six-month bill, FESTI270322, in the nominal amount of ISK 1,000 million, at terms corresponding to a flat interest rate of 8.65%. The bill is expected to be admitted to trading and listed on Nasdaq Iceland.The settlement date is scheduled for Tuesday, 22 Se…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Festi hf. has completed the sale of a new six-month bill, FESTI270322, in the nominal amount of ISK 1,000 million, at terms corresponding to a flat interest rate of 8.65%. The bill is expected to be admitted to trading and listed on Nasdaq Iceland."]},{"type":"p","children":["The settlement date is scheduled for Tuesday, 22 September 2026. Subsequently, an application will be submitted for the bills to be admitted to trading on Nasdaq Iceland."]},{"type":"p","children":["Íslandsbanki hf. managed the issuance and sale of the bills, as well as the admission of the bills to trading on the Main Market of Nasdaq Iceland."]},{"type":"p","children":["A base prospectus and a supplement thereto have been published in connection with the Company’s issuance programme. The base prospectus, final terms and other documents relating to the issuance and admission to trading on Nasdaq Iceland will be made available on the Company’s website: ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=mij28yb1vX9BaRtFgPKJXArxSUaFeV2Hcut9hJd0pXoD2s5lAWw40vtdpCYX_6Jg2mCJoiWdtkaRoJ3zcrRJnAubkbdmD1TrQ9bRjl60TWIIBvXPCJYpkACL1Ca__bm4lNrOVYYqfJ3Jp_mTjD95QqCL4WwmKGH8JF9qW9kv9EQvXscIAngGl2LGKvA5R990v1BWChP0_Tdt0grAv16Ru6QE_HIvO-EMbDCnIYduOV0n3z3xRHeYcPpE1HZxXXTRN1ODmLEElQLM7HTE9dbdwhk0E34PYeBaAGFexr8kDyp4L9OUri2e1K6fIHrGsdoFmputopze_s5cYplTIxVRp56QAPM6Hl_bt0nuscq-gEuD5V6GLYJFHipkvWDCAvuegXmZmeVrSKz4Ws7oh6bDlTXE19gn1YKF2o-r0vyhTd9EvG8_LwO8rP37fCt1YsslcFlkClTayuoIxgdmGyJWESukX--78ezg97KvIZHtLrkoBbC69WzYOWWo1_HzOKrmi-ZlEmLsHMFGKu9SqFAjdo3PtogXlzj5s9PucJi1zkAjW6TEPkkfX7fhMJTEY_1qe0GieKtH04El8w79bG